Description: |
  Documents the persistence-layer aggregator (SignalDatabase), the base type/notification
  convention every table follows (`DatabaseTable`/`DatabaseObserver`), and one representative
  table (`RecipientTable`) standing in for the ~90 other tables in this directory that follow
  the identical constructor and base-type shape. Depends only on recipients (for `RecipientId`).
